WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.049
Today we will share artworks with an audience. Our work connects with Ghanaian and

00:00:05.049 --> 00:00:06.088
other African artists.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.702
Choose finished works and give each a title label.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:15.629
Place the works where viewers can see them without crowding. Record why your chosen

00:00:15.629 --> 00:00:16.966
technique suits the message.

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:21.687
Guide visitors to observe one artwork and ask a respectful question.
